findings.observed:
- `packages/groups/README.md:31-105` covers `Group`, `GroupType`, `GroupsServiceProvider::register()` and bundle fields. `README.md:7-19` already covers the July 2026 API exposure (#2045) and the opt-in directory (#2080).
